# SMTP Configuration for Nodemailer
# You can use your business email (cpanel/hostinger) or Gmail
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your-app-password
CONTACT_EMAIL=infos@luptek.com

# Setup Instructions for Gmail:
# 1. Go to Google Account > Security > 2-Step Verification (Enable it)
# 2. Go to App Passwords (search for it)
# 3. Create new app password, name it "Looptech Website"
# 4. Copy the generated 16-character password into SMTP_PASSWORD above
